# Keep LF line endings everywhere, including on Windows checkouts.
#
# Why this matters: with core.autocrlf=true (the Windows default), a clone rewrites files to CRLF.
# The shell scripts here then fail with `$'\r': command not found`, and the sensitive-content
# scanner silently stops working — which is the one thing that must never fail quietly.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
